WEBVTT

1
00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:24.420
Stay down, pussy hole.

2
00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:30.019
Nah.

3
00:00:32.439 --> 00:00:34.719
I'm with you.

4
00:00:35.799 --> 00:00:36.799
Let's hit him.

5
00:00:45.899 --> 00:00:46.840
We won.

6
00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:50.060
But this shit's just starting.

7
00:00:57.719 --> 00:00:59.219
You done good out there, bruv.

8
00:01:03.299 --> 00:01:04.040
Hello.

9
00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:06.400
Liam, good to hear your voice, bro.

10
00:01:08.879 --> 00:01:09.320
You too,

11
00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:11.260
bro. I thought they were stopping your

12
00:01:11.359 --> 00:01:12.080
calls.

13
00:01:12.180 --> 00:01:14.460
They was. They filed a court order

14
00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:16.659
to cut off contact with me on the outside.

15
00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:18.750
Said I contribute to ongoing crime.

16
00:01:19.379 --> 00:01:21.179
My lawyer got that shit struck down.

17
00:01:22.079 --> 00:01:23.079
Now I get visitors.

18
00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:26.219
I want you to come see me soon as you can.

19
00:01:28.079 --> 00:01:29.079
I'm there, bruv.

20
00:01:30.079 --> 00:01:31.760
You probably thought it was weird.

21
00:01:32.599 --> 00:01:33.780
A huge fight,

22
00:01:33.879 --> 00:01:35.129
and no one pulls a knife.

23
00:01:36.859 --> 00:01:38.409
Truth is, we live under a code.

24
00:01:41.739 --> 00:01:42.520
Years ago,

25
00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:44.420
all crews made a deal with the pigs.

26
00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:47.019
If we use fists, didn't kill,

27
00:01:47.680 --> 00:01:49.510
and dealt nothing harder than weed,

28
00:01:49.719 --> 00:01:51.319
they'd stay out of our business.

29
00:01:52.060 --> 00:01:53.700
But the ambush at Southeast Croydon jarred

30
00:01:53.799 --> 00:01:54.739
with the deal.

31
00:01:55.459 --> 00:01:58.200
Trains, live tracks.

32
00:01:58.879 --> 00:02:00.480
The fact no one was killed,

33
00:02:00.579 --> 00:02:01.579
it was luck.

34
00:02:03.859 --> 00:02:05.359
That's the danger if they win.

35
00:02:07.299 --> 00:02:08.860
They might just decide they don't need

36
00:02:08.960 --> 00:02:10.919
the deal if they've got an empire.

37
00:02:12.469 --> 00:02:13.740
It's good to see you, man.

38
00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:16.879
Shit's been lonely since you went down.

39
00:02:17.520 --> 00:02:19.500
Good to see you too, bro. Lonely or not,

40
00:02:19.599 --> 00:02:21.139
you've been leading from the front.

41
00:02:24.199 --> 00:02:26.000
They gave me a private visiting room

42
00:02:26.300 --> 00:02:27.840
'cause they were worried my brief would

43
00:02:27.939 --> 00:02:29.039
go for costs.

44
00:02:29.979 --> 00:02:31.479
But there's ears in here, too.

45
00:02:33.759 --> 00:02:36.620
Viper probing your borders was him

46
00:02:36.719 --> 00:02:37.000
testing

47
00:02:37.099 --> 00:02:38.099
your defenses.

48
00:02:39.479 --> 00:02:42.140
The ambush at East Croydon was him testing

49
00:02:42.240 --> 00:02:43.390
your head for strategy.

50
00:02:44.259 --> 00:02:46.340
He'll keep testing till he finds a weakness,

51
00:02:46.439 --> 00:02:48.439
and he'll destroy it. It's what he does.

52
00:02:49.780 --> 00:02:51.759
I don't know Can or Harrington too well,

53
00:02:52.340 --> 00:02:53.920
but I know Viper better than anyone else

54
00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:54.900
in this...

55
00:02:57.099 --> 00:02:58.599
He ain't just a snake by name.

56
00:03:00.219 --> 00:03:01.520
What's he gonna test next?

57
00:03:02.199 --> 00:03:03.199
Your nerve.

58
00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:06.099
He's gonna take the fight to you. Next

59
00:03:06.199 --> 00:03:07.449
is a full frontal attack.

60
00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:09.539
Listen, there's one thing we ain't talked

61
00:03:09.639 --> 00:03:10.389
about.

62
00:03:12.039 --> 00:03:13.039
Why are you here?

63
00:03:16.199 --> 00:03:17.560
Assault, theft,

64
00:03:18.219 --> 00:03:19.770
possession with intent to sell.

65
00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:22.390
That's the shit I actually did.

66
00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:25.050
You know what I mean.

67
00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:27.180
Why are you here?

68
00:03:27.319 --> 00:03:29.120
No. What do you mean?

69
00:03:31.240 --> 00:03:31.980
Don't pull that thread,

70
00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:34.400
bro. If you pull that thread,

71
00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:35.849
you'll end up here with me.

72
00:03:38.460 --> 00:03:39.860
And you've got a war to win.

73
00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:42.740
Maybe I can help.

74
00:03:43.639 --> 00:03:44.140
Leave it alone,

75
00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:45.539
bro. That's an order.

76
00:03:57.719 --> 00:03:59.099
Joe never told any of you about why he

77
00:03:59.199 --> 00:04:00.199
went down, right?

78
00:04:00.520 --> 00:04:02.760
Nah. No way one of the others would keep

79
00:04:02.860 --> 00:04:05.000
it. No idea.

80
00:04:05.099 --> 00:04:06.650
He told me not to look into it,

81
00:04:07.020 --> 00:04:09.240
but fuck it. You got the best cop

82
00:04:09.340 --> 00:04:10.260
connections.

83
00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:11.460
See what you can find.
